 * Arrow functions inherit `this` from the enclosing scope,
 * while function() creates its own `this`.
 *
 * @param {number} base - Value to add to each number
 * @returns {{ values: number[], addMultiple: Function }}
 *   addMultiple(nums) - for each n in nums, pushes (base + n) into values
 */
